  title: 'US index weekly trend rule',
  description: 'Weekly closes (last session of each completed week) against the weekly EMA12 and EMA21: above both is Uptrend intact, below both is Below both, otherwise Between. The current week counts only once it is over. This week so far compares the latest level with the last completed weekly EMAs.',
